WEBVTT

00:10:29.092 --> 00:10:30.260
over and over.

00:10:30.293 --> 00:10:37.033
So trust your intuition that it's not you
bringing paranoia to the workplace,

00:10:37.066 --> 00:10:42.238
that these kind of stereotypes
and otherisms are rife and alive.

00:10:42.272 --> 00:10:44.007
I think that's the first thing.

00:10:44.040 --> 00:10:47.944
And then the second thing
is having these layers of support

00:10:47.977 --> 00:10:50.680
around mentors and sponsors,

00:10:50.680 --> 00:10:54.417
who can tell you
that you are doing just fine,

00:10:54.450 --> 00:10:57.020
there's something amiss
in this environment.

00:10:57.053 --> 00:11:00.356
That layer of support
is incredibly important.